Changes to github.com/yzhou216/flake under test, as a diff against
1dd2043, under the terms of that repository:

  b58263a iris: accept the module arguments of nix-darwin
  1026eed commons: drop the settings of the disabled networkmanager
  5366a98 lexi: explain why the nixbld group id is set
  7f44c46 scripts: switch to the iris configuration in darwin_setup.sh
  63aca28 scripts: match only the sip status line in darwin_setup.sh
  05dccaf scripts: pass the password to sudo verbatim in darwin_setup.sh
  51bf001 scripts: run darwin-rebuild as root in darwin_setup.sh

